//@version=6
// =============================================================================
// Value Area Reversion Strategy (VARS-S)
// =============================================================================
// Strategy conversion of the "Value Area Reversion Signals" indicator (VARS).
//
// The profile engine and the reclaim-signal state machine in sections 3-7 are a
// faithful port of the indicator. Do not edit one without the other, or the
// strategy stops trading the signals the indicator draws.
//
// WHAT THE INDICATOR PROVIDED
//   An anchored (18:00 America/New_York) volume profile, its value area, and a
//   "reclaim" signal: price breaks out of the value area, the breakout volume
//   decelerates, then an engulfing bar with dominant opposite-side volume closes
//   back inside the value area.
//
// WHAT THE INDICATOR DID NOT PROVIDE  -- and therefore what is NEW here
//   No stop, no target, no invalidation, no sizing, no session handling. All of
//   the P&L comes from those choices, none of which the original author made.
//   They are inputs here rather than buried constants, because they are the part
//   of this system most likely to be wrong.
//
// STRUCTURAL LIMITS -- read before trusting any backtest
//
//   1. THE SIGNAL IS RARE. A reclaim needs six conjunctive conditions (breakout,
//      >= 2 breakout bars, decelerating breakout volume, return inside the VA,
//      an engulfing bar, and reclaim volume exceeding both the opposite side and
//      the last breakout bar). Expect single-digit signals per month on 5m. Any
//      parameter tuned on that sample is fitted to noise, not to an edge.
//
//   2. VOLUME SIDING IS A PROXY. currentUpVolume / currentDownVolume assign the
//      WHOLE bar's volume to one side based on close >= open. This is not
//      delta. "Volume was slowing" therefore means "the bar's total volume fell
//      while the bar happened to close down", which is a much weaker statement
//      than order-flow deceleration. A bullish bar during a bearish breakout
//      contributes zero down-volume and does not update the deceleration state
//      at all -- that quirk is preserved for fidelity, not because it is right.
//
//   3. THE DEVELOPING VALUE AREA IS UNSTABLE. When a session bar makes a new
//      extreme, the profile range and bin size are rebuilt and every level moves.
//      Early in a session the current-day VA is built from a handful of bars and
//      is close to meaningless. This is why current-day signals default OFF,
//      matching the indicator.
//
//   4. GEOMETRY IS THE REAL CONSTRAINT. A stop at the breakout extreme and a
//      target at the POC frequently produce sub-1R trades. The min-R filter
//      exists to reject those, and it will reject a large share of signals. The
//      dashboard reports how many, because a strategy that filters away 70% of
//      an already-rare signal is a different strategy than the one you thought
//      you were testing.
//
//   5. FILLS. Entries are issued at signal-bar close and fill at the next bar's
//      open, so a gap through the stop exits immediately at a worse price. That
//      is realistic, not a bug. Set commission and slippage for your instrument
//      before reading any equity curve; the defaults are ES-shaped placeholders.
// =============================================================================

strategy("Value Area Reversion Strategy", "VARS-S", overlay = true,
     default_qty_type        = strategy.fixed,
     default_qty_value       = 1,
     initial_capital         = 50000,
     commission_type         = strategy.commission.cash_per_contract,
     commission_value        = 2.50,
     slippage                = 2,
     pyramiding              = 0,
     process_orders_on_close = false,
     calc_on_every_tick      = false,
     max_bars_back           = 5000,
     max_boxes_count         = 500,
     max_lines_count         = 50,
     max_labels_count        = 500)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1 - Constants
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
string ANCHOR_TIMEZONE = "America/New_York"
int    ANCHOR_HOUR     = 18

string GRP_SIGNAL = "1 - Signals"
string GRP_PROF   = "2 - Profile"
string GRP_ENTRY  = "3 - Entry filters"
string GRP_STOP   = "4 - Stop loss"
string GRP_TGT    = "5 - Targets"
string GRP_MGMT   = "6 - Trade management"
string GRP_SIZE   = "7 - Position sizing"
string GRP_DISP   = "8 - Display"

string SRC_PREV = "Previous session value area"
string SRC_CURR = "Current session value area"
string SRC_BOTH = "Both (previous takes priority)"

string DIR_BOTH  = "Both"
string DIR_LONG  = "Long only"
string DIR_SHORT = "Short only"

string SL_BREAKOUT = "Breakout extreme"
string SL_SIGNAL   = "Signal bar extreme"
string SL_ATR      = "ATR from entry"
string SL_VAEDGE   = "Broken value-area edge"

string TP_POC    = "Reference POC"
string TP_OPP    = "Opposite value-area edge"
string TP_R      = "R multiple"
string TP_ATR    = "ATR multiple"

string SZ_FIXED = "Fixed contracts"
string SZ_RISK  = "Risk % of equity"

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2 - Inputs
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// -- Signals (ported from the indicator) --
string signalSourceInput = input.string(SRC_PREV, "Signal source", options = [SRC_PREV, SRC_CURR, SRC_BOTH], group = GRP_SIGNAL,
     tooltip = "Which value area the reclaim signal is measured against. The indicator defaults to the previous session only; the developing current-session VA is unstable early in a session.")
int maxReversionBarsInput = input.int(10, "Maximum bars to signal after breakout", minval = 1, maxval = 100, group = GRP_SIGNAL,
     tooltip = "A reclaim signal is only allowed within this many bars after price first breaks the value area.")

// -- Profile (ported verbatim) --
int rowsInput = input.int(60, "Rows", minval = 10, maxval = 150, group = GRP_PROF,
     tooltip = "Number of price rows used to build the anchored volume profile.")
float valueAreaPercentInput = input.float(70.0, "Value area (%)", minval = 50.0, maxval = 99.0, step = 0.5, group = GRP_PROF,
     tooltip = "Percentage of the profile volume included in the value area, expanded outward from the POC.")
int profileWidthInput = input.int(30, "Maximum profile width (bars)", minval = 5, maxval = 200, group = GRP_PROF,
     tooltip = "Maximum horizontal width of the profile histogram. The profile starts at the 18:00 anchor bar.")
float insignificantThresholdInput = input.float(20.0, "Insignificant volume threshold (%)", minval = 0.0, maxval = 100.0, step = 1.0, group = GRP_PROF,
     tooltip = "Profile rows below this percentage of the highest-volume row are colored grey.")

// -- Entry filters --
string tradeDirectionInput = input.string(DIR_BOTH, "Trade direction", options = [DIR_BOTH, DIR_LONG, DIR_SHORT], group = GRP_ENTRY)
bool useTradingWindowInput = input.bool(false, "Restrict entries to a session window", group = GRP_ENTRY,
     tooltip = "OFF: trade any signal in the 18:00-anchored day, overnight included. ON: only inside the window below. Overnight reclaims form on thin volume, which is exactly the input the signal trusts most.")
string tradingWindowInput = input.session("0930-1600", "Entry window", group = GRP_ENTRY)
float minRewardRiskInput = input.float(1.0, "Minimum reward:risk", minval = 0.0, maxval = 10.0, step = 0.1, group = GRP_ENTRY,
     tooltip = "Signals whose final target is closer than this multiple of the stop distance are skipped. Raising this filters away a large share of an already-rare signal -- watch the skip count on the dashboard.")
float minStopTicksInput = input.float(4.0, "Minimum stop distance (ticks)", minval = 1.0, step = 1.0, group = GRP_ENTRY,
     tooltip = "Rejects degenerate geometry where the signal bar sits on top of the breakout extreme.")
float maxStopAtrInput = input.float(3.0, "Maximum stop distance (ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.25, group = GRP_ENTRY,
     tooltip = "Rejects signals whose stop is unreasonably far. 0 disables the check.")
int maxTradesPerSessionInput = input.int(2, "Maximum entries per anchored session", minval = 1, maxval = 20, group = GRP_ENTRY)

// -- Stop loss --
string stopModeInput = input.string(SL_BREAKOUT, "Stop placement", options = [SL_BREAKOUT, SL_SIGNAL, SL_ATR, SL_VAEDGE], group = GRP_STOP,
     tooltip = "Breakout extreme: the furthest point reached outside the value area during the excursion, which is the level that invalidates the reclaim.")
float stopBufferAtrInput = input.float(0.10, "Stop buffer (ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = GRP_STOP)
float stopAtrMultInput = input.float(1.5, "Stop ATR multiple", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = GRP_STOP,
     tooltip = "Only used when stop placement is 'ATR from entry'.")
int atrLengthInput = input.int(14, "ATR length", minval = 1, maxval = 200, group = GRP_STOP)

// -- Targets --
bool usePartialInput = input.bool(true, "Scale out at the first target", group = GRP_TGT,
     tooltip = "The POC is a much higher-probability touch than the far value-area edge. Taking part of the position there is what makes the sub-1R geometry survivable.")
float partialPercentInput = input.float(50.0, "First target size (% of position)", minval = 5.0, maxval = 95.0, step = 5.0, group = GRP_TGT)
string firstTargetInput = input.string(TP_POC, "First target", options = [TP_POC, TP_OPP, TP_R, TP_ATR], group = GRP_TGT)
string finalTargetInput = input.string(TP_OPP, "Final target", options = [TP_OPP, TP_POC, TP_R, TP_ATR], group = GRP_TGT)
float firstTargetRInput = input.float(1.0, "First target R multiple", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = GRP_TGT)
float finalTargetRInput = input.float(2.0, "Final target R multiple", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = GRP_TGT)
float firstTargetAtrInput = input.float(1.0, "First target ATR multiple", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = GRP_TGT)
float finalTargetAtrInput = input.float(2.0, "Final target ATR multiple", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = GRP_TGT)

// -- Trade management --
bool moveToBreakevenInput = input.bool(true, "Move stop to breakeven after the first target", group = GRP_MGMT)
float breakevenOffsetAtrInput = input.float(0.05, "Breakeven offset (ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = GRP_MGMT)
bool exitOnRebreakInput = input.bool(true, "Exit if price closes back outside the value area", group = GRP_MGMT,
     tooltip = "The thesis of the trade is that the breakout failed. A close back outside the reference value area says it did not. This usually exits before the stop and is the single most consequential management setting here.")
int maxBarsInTradeInput = input.int(0, "Time stop (bars, 0 = off)", minval = 0, maxval = 500, group = GRP_MGMT,
     tooltip = "Mean-reversion trades that have not resolved are decaying option premium. 0 disables.")
bool flatAtAnchorInput = input.bool(true, "Close positions at the 18:00 anchor rollover", group = GRP_MGMT,
     tooltip = "At the anchor the reference value area is replaced, so an open trade's levels no longer exist. Holding through it is holding a position whose thesis has been deleted.")

// -- Sizing --
string sizingModeInput = input.string(SZ_FIXED, "Position sizing", options = [SZ_FIXED, SZ_RISK], group = GRP_SIZE)
int fixedQtyInput = input.int(1, "Fixed contracts", minval = 1, group = GRP_SIZE)
float riskPercentInput = input.float(0.5, "Risk % of equity", minval = 0.01, maxval = 10.0, step = 0.05, group = GRP_SIZE)
int maxQtyInput = input.int(20, "Maximum contracts", minval = 1, group = GRP_SIZE)

// -- Display --
bool showProfileInput = input.bool(true, "Show current profile", group = GRP_DISP)
bool showPreviousProfileInput = input.bool(true, "Show previous profile", group = GRP_DISP)
bool showLevelsInput = input.bool(true, "Show value-area levels", group = GRP_DISP)
bool showPocInput = input.bool(false, "Show POC", group = GRP_DISP)
bool showDashboardInput = input.bool(true, "Show dashboard", group = GRP_DISP)
bool showSignalMarkersInput = input.bool(true, "Show reclaim markers", group = GRP_DISP)
color valueAreaHighColorInput = input.color(color.new(#089981, 0), "VAH", group = GRP_DISP)
color valueAreaLowColorInput = input.color(color.new(#f23645, 0), "VAL", group = GRP_DISP)
color pocColorInput = input.color(color.new(#5b9cf6, 0), "POC", group = GRP_DISP)
color upVolumeColorInput = input.color(color.new(#089981, 35), "Up-volume profile", group = GRP_DISP)
color downVolumeColorInput = input.color(color.new(#f23645, 35), "Down-volume profile", group = GRP_DISP)
color profileOutlineColorInput = input.color(color.new(color.gray, 100), "Profile outline", group = GRP_DISP)
color insignificantProfileColorInput = input.color(color.new(color.gray, 20), "Insignificant profile rows", group = GRP_DISP)
color bullishReclaimSignalColorInput = input.color(#089981, "Bullish reclaim", group = GRP_DISP)
color bearishReclaimSignalColorInput = input.color(#f23645, "Bearish reclaim", group = GRP_DISP)

bool useCurrentSignals  = signalSourceInput == SRC_CURR or signalSourceInput == SRC_BOTH
bool usePreviousSignals = signalSourceInput == SRC_PREV or signalSourceInput == SRC_BOTH

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3 - Profile helper functions (ported verbatim from the indicator)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
addVolumeToBins(array<float> bins, float barLow, float barHigh, float barVolume, float rangeLow, float binSize, int rows) =>
    int binCount = array.size(bins)
    if barVolume > 0 and binSize > 0 and binCount > 0
        int firstIndex = int(math.floor((barLow - rangeLow) / binSize))
        int lastIndex = int(math.floor((barHigh - rangeLow) / binSize))
        firstIndex := math.max(0, math.min(binCount - 1, firstIndex))
        lastIndex := math.max(0, math.min(binCount - 1, lastIndex))
        if firstIndex <= lastIndex
            float volumePerBin = barVolume / (lastIndex - firstIndex + 1)
            for binIndex = firstIndex to lastIndex
                if binIndex >= 0 and binIndex < binCount
                    array.set(bins, binIndex, array.get(bins, binIndex) + volumePerBin)

resetBins(array<float> bins, int rows) =>
    array.clear(bins)
    for binIndex = 0 to rows - 1
        array.push(bins, 0.0)

getProfileLevels(array<float> bins, float rangeLow, float stepSize, float valueAreaPercent) =>
    int binCount = array.size(bins)
    float totalVolume = 0.0
    float maximumVolume = 0.0
    int pocBinIndex = 0
    if binCount > 0
        for binIndex = 0 to binCount - 1
            float binVolume = array.get(bins, binIndex)
            totalVolume += binVolume
            if binVolume > maximumVolume
                maximumVolume := binVolume
                pocBinIndex := binIndex
    float targetVolume = totalVolume * valueAreaPercent / 100.0
    float accumulatedVolume = maximumVolume
    int valueAreaLowBinIndex = pocBinIndex
    int valueAreaHighBinIndex = pocBinIndex
    if totalVolume > 0
        for expansion = 1 to binCount
            if accumulatedVolume >= targetVolume
                break
            int lowerIndex = pocBinIndex - expansion
            int upperIndex = pocBinIndex + expansion
            bool canExpandLower = lowerIndex >= 0 and lowerIndex < binCount
            bool canExpandUpper = upperIndex >= 0 and upperIndex < binCount
            float lowerVolume = 0.0
            float upperVolume = 0.0
            if canExpandLower
                lowerVolume := array.get(bins, lowerIndex)
            if canExpandUpper
                upperVolume := array.get(bins, upperIndex)
            if canExpandLower and (not canExpandUpper or lowerVolume >= upperVolume)
                accumulatedVolume += lowerVolume
                valueAreaLowBinIndex := lowerIndex
            else if canExpandUpper
                accumulatedVolume += upperVolume
                valueAreaHighBinIndex := upperIndex
    float valueAreaLow = totalVolume > 0 ? rangeLow + valueAreaLowBinIndex * stepSize : na
    float valueAreaHigh = totalVolume > 0 ? rangeLow + (valueAreaHighBinIndex + 1) * stepSize : na
    float pointOfControl = totalVolume > 0 ? rangeLow + (pocBinIndex + 0.5) * stepSize : na
    [valueAreaHigh, valueAreaLow, pointOfControl]

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 4 - Persistent state
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
var array<float> barHighArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> barLowArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> upVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> downVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> profileVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> profileUpVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> profileDownVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> previousProfileVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> previousProfileUpVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<float> previousProfileDownVolumeArray = array.new_float()
var array<box> profileBoxArray = array.new<box>()

var bool  bearishBreakoutActive = false
var bool  bullishBreakoutActive = false
var bool  bearishVolumeWasSlowing = false
var bool  bullishVolumeWasSlowing = false
var float lastBearishBreakoutVolume = na
var float lastBullishBreakoutVolume = na
var int   bearishBreakoutBars = 0
var int   bullishBreakoutBars = 0
var float bearishBreakoutLow = na
var float bullishBreakoutHigh = na

var bool  previousBearishBreakoutActive = false
var bool  previousBullishBreakoutActive = false
var bool  previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing = false
var bool  previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing = false
var float previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume = na
var float previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume = na
var int   previousBearishBreakoutBars = 0
var int   previousBullishBreakoutBars = 0
var float previousBearishBreakoutLow = na
var float previousBullishBreakoutHigh = na

var int   activeAnchorTimestamp = na
var int   activeAnchorBarIndex = na
var float profileLow = na
var float profileHigh = na
var float binSize = na
var int   previousAnchorBarIndex = na
var float previousProfileLow = na
var float previousBinSize = na
var bool  hasPreviousProfile = false

var int sessionEntryCount = 0

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 5 - Anchor detection and rollover
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
int localYear = year(time, ANCHOR_TIMEZONE)
int localMonth = month(time, ANCHOR_TIMEZONE)
int localDay = dayofmonth(time, ANCHOR_TIMEZONE)
int todaysAnchorTimestamp = timestamp(ANCHOR_TIMEZONE, localYear, localMonth, localDay, ANCHOR_HOUR, 0)
int anchorTimestamp = time >= todaysAnchorTimestamp ? todaysAnchorTimestamp : timestamp(ANCHOR_TIMEZONE, localYear, localMonth, localDay - 1, ANCHOR_HOUR, 0)
bool isNewAnchor = na(activeAnchorTimestamp) or anchorTimestamp != activeAnchorTimestamp

if isNewAnchor
    if not na(activeAnchorTimestamp) and not na(profileLow) and array.size(profileVolumeArray) > 0
        previousProfileVolumeArray := array.copy(profileVolumeArray)
        previousProfileUpVolumeArray := array.copy(profileUpVolumeArray)
        previousProfileDownVolumeArray := array.copy(profileDownVolumeArray)
        previousAnchorBarIndex := activeAnchorBarIndex
        previousProfileLow := profileLow
        previousBinSize := binSize
        hasPreviousProfile := true
    activeAnchorTimestamp := anchorTimestamp
    activeAnchorBarIndex := bar_index
    array.clear(barHighArray)
    array.clear(barLowArray)
    array.clear(upVolumeArray)
    array.clear(downVolumeArray)
    bearishBreakoutActive := false
    bullishBreakoutActive := false
    bearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
    bullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
    lastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
    lastBullishBreakoutVolume := na
    bearishBreakoutBars := 0
    bullishBreakoutBars := 0
    bearishBreakoutLow := na
    bullishBreakoutHigh := na
    previousBearishBreakoutActive := false
    previousBullishBreakoutActive := false
    previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
    previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
    previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
    previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume := na
    previousBearishBreakoutBars := 0
    previousBullishBreakoutBars := 0
    previousBearishBreakoutLow := na
    previousBullishBreakoutHigh := na
    sessionEntryCount := 0
    profileLow := na
    profileHigh := na
    binSize := na
    resetBins(profileVolumeArray, rowsInput)
    resetBins(profileUpVolumeArray, rowsInput)
    resetBins(profileDownVolumeArray, rowsInput)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6 - Volume accumulation and profile rebuild
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
float currentVolume = nz(volume, 0.0)
float currentUpVolume = close >= open ? currentVolume : 0.0
float currentDownVolume = close < open ? currentVolume : 0.0
array.push(barHighArray, high)
array.push(barLowArray, low)
array.push(upVolumeArray, currentUpVolume)
array.push(downVolumeArray, currentDownVolume)

bool rangeChanged = na(profileLow) or low < profileLow or high > profileHigh
if rangeChanged
    profileLow := na(profileLow) ? low : math.min(profileLow, low)
    profileHigh := na(profileHigh) ? high : math.max(profileHigh, high)
    binSize := math.max((profileHigh - profileLow) / rowsInput, syminfo.mintick)
    resetBins(profileVolumeArray, rowsInput)
    resetBins(profileUpVolumeArray, rowsInput)
    resetBins(profileDownVolumeArray, rowsInput)
    int storedBars = array.size(barHighArray)
    for storedBarIndex = 0 to storedBars - 1
        float storedHigh = array.get(barHighArray, storedBarIndex)
        float storedLow = array.get(barLowArray, storedBarIndex)
        float storedUpVolume = array.get(upVolumeArray, storedBarIndex)
        float storedDownVolume = array.get(downVolumeArray, storedBarIndex)
        addVolumeToBins(profileUpVolumeArray, storedLow, storedHigh, storedUpVolume, profileLow, binSize, rowsInput)
        addVolumeToBins(profileDownVolumeArray, storedLow, storedHigh, storedDownVolume, profileLow, binSize, rowsInput)
        addVolumeToBins(profileVolumeArray, storedLow, storedHigh, storedUpVolume + storedDownVolume, profileLow, binSize, rowsInput)
else
    addVolumeToBins(profileUpVolumeArray, low, high, currentUpVolume, profileLow, binSize, rowsInput)
    addVolumeToBins(profileDownVolumeArray, low, high, currentDownVolume, profileLow, binSize, rowsInput)
    addVolumeToBins(profileVolumeArray, low, high, currentVolume, profileLow, binSize, rowsInput)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 7 - Value area levels
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
int profileBinCount = array.size(profileVolumeArray)
float totalProfileVolume = 0.0
float maximumBinVolume = 0.0
int pocIndex = 0
for binIndex = 0 to profileBinCount - 1
    float binVolume = array.get(profileVolumeArray, binIndex)
    totalProfileVolume += binVolume
    if binVolume > maximumBinVolume
        maximumBinVolume := binVolume
        pocIndex := binIndex

float valueAreaTarget = totalProfileVolume * valueAreaPercentInput / 100.0
float valueAreaAccumulated = maximumBinVolume
int valueAreaLowIndex = pocIndex
int valueAreaHighIndex = pocIndex
if totalProfileVolume > 0
    for expansion = 1 to profileBinCount
        if valueAreaAccumulated >= valueAreaTarget
            break
        int lowerIndex = pocIndex - expansion
        int upperIndex = pocIndex + expansion
        bool canExpandLower = lowerIndex >= 0 and lowerIndex < profileBinCount
        bool canExpandUpper = upperIndex >= 0 and upperIndex < profileBinCount
        float lowerVolume = 0.0
        float upperVolume = 0.0
        if canExpandLower
            lowerVolume := array.get(profileVolumeArray, lowerIndex)
        if canExpandUpper
            upperVolume := array.get(profileVolumeArray, upperIndex)
        if canExpandLower and (not canExpandUpper or lowerVolume >= upperVolume)
            valueAreaAccumulated += lowerVolume
            valueAreaLowIndex := lowerIndex
        else if canExpandUpper
            valueAreaAccumulated += upperVolume
            valueAreaHighIndex := upperIndex

float valueAreaLow = totalProfileVolume > 0 ? profileLow + valueAreaLowIndex * binSize : na
float valueAreaHigh = totalProfileVolume > 0 ? profileLow + (valueAreaHighIndex + 1) * binSize : na
float pointOfControl = totalProfileVolume > 0 ? profileLow + (pocIndex + 0.5) * binSize : na
[previousValueAreaHigh, previousValueAreaLow, previousPointOfControl] = getProfileLevels(previousProfileVolumeArray, previousProfileLow, previousBinSize, valueAreaPercentInput)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 8 - Reclaim signal state machines (ported, plus breakout-extreme tracking)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
float atrValue = ta.atr(atrLengthInput)

bool bullishEngulfing = close > open and close[1] < open[1] and open <= close[1] and close >= open[1]
bool bearishEngulfing = close < open and close[1] > open[1] and open >= close[1] and close <= open[1]

bool bullishReclaimSignal = false
bool bearishReclaimSignal = false
bool hasValueArea = not na(valueAreaLow) and not na(valueAreaHigh)
if hasValueArea
    if close < valueAreaLow
        bullishBreakoutActive := false
        bullishBreakoutBars := 0
        bullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        lastBullishBreakoutVolume := na
        bullishBreakoutHigh := na
        if not bearishBreakoutActive
            bearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
            lastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
            bearishBreakoutBars := 1
            bearishBreakoutLow := low
        else
            bearishBreakoutBars += 1
            bearishBreakoutLow := math.min(nz(bearishBreakoutLow, low), low)
        bearishBreakoutActive := true
        if currentDownVolume > 0
            if not na(lastBearishBreakoutVolume) and currentDownVolume < lastBearishBreakoutVolume
                bearishVolumeWasSlowing := true
            lastBearishBreakoutVolume := currentDownVolume
    else if close > valueAreaHigh
        bearishBreakoutActive := false
        bearishBreakoutBars := 0
        bearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        lastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
        bearishBreakoutLow := na
        if not bullishBreakoutActive
            bullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
            lastBullishBreakoutVolume := na
            bullishBreakoutBars := 1
            bullishBreakoutHigh := high
        else
            bullishBreakoutBars += 1
            bullishBreakoutHigh := math.max(nz(bullishBreakoutHigh, high), high)
        bullishBreakoutActive := true
        if currentUpVolume > 0
            if not na(lastBullishBreakoutVolume) and currentUpVolume < lastBullishBreakoutVolume
                bullishVolumeWasSlowing := true
            lastBullishBreakoutVolume := currentUpVolume
    else
        bullishReclaimSignal := bullishEngulfing and bearishBreakoutActive and bearishBreakoutBars <= maxReversionBarsInput and bearishVolumeWasSlowing and currentUpVolume > currentDownVolume and currentUpVolume > nz(lastBearishBreakoutVolume, 0.0)
        bearishReclaimSignal := bearishEngulfing and bullishBreakoutActive and bullishBreakoutBars <= maxReversionBarsInput and bullishVolumeWasSlowing and currentDownVolume > currentUpVolume and currentDownVolume > nz(lastBullishBreakoutVolume, 0.0)
        bearishBreakoutActive := false
        bullishBreakoutActive := false
        bearishBreakoutBars := 0
        bullishBreakoutBars := 0
        bearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        bullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        lastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
        lastBullishBreakoutVolume := na

bool previousBullishReclaimSignal = false
bool previousBearishReclaimSignal = false
bool hasPreviousSignalValueArea = hasPreviousProfile and not na(previousValueAreaLow) and not na(previousValueAreaHigh)
if hasPreviousSignalValueArea
    if close < previousValueAreaLow
        previousBullishBreakoutActive := false
        previousBullishBreakoutBars := 0
        previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume := na
        previousBullishBreakoutHigh := na
        if not previousBearishBreakoutActive
            previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
            previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
            previousBearishBreakoutBars := 1
            previousBearishBreakoutLow := low
        else
            previousBearishBreakoutBars += 1
            previousBearishBreakoutLow := math.min(nz(previousBearishBreakoutLow, low), low)
        previousBearishBreakoutActive := true
        if currentDownVolume > 0
            if not na(previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume) and currentDownVolume < previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume
                previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing := true
            previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume := currentDownVolume
    else if close > previousValueAreaHigh
        previousBearishBreakoutActive := false
        previousBearishBreakoutBars := 0
        previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
        previousBearishBreakoutLow := na
        if not previousBullishBreakoutActive
            previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
            previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume := na
            previousBullishBreakoutBars := 1
            previousBullishBreakoutHigh := high
        else
            previousBullishBreakoutBars += 1
            previousBullishBreakoutHigh := math.max(nz(previousBullishBreakoutHigh, high), high)
        previousBullishBreakoutActive := true
        if currentUpVolume > 0
            if not na(previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume) and currentUpVolume < previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume
                previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing := true
            previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume := currentUpVolume
    else
        previousBullishReclaimSignal := bullishEngulfing and previousBearishBreakoutActive and previousBearishBreakoutBars <= maxReversionBarsInput and previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing and currentUpVolume > currentDownVolume and currentUpVolume > nz(previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume, 0.0)
        previousBearishReclaimSignal := bearishEngulfing and previousBullishBreakoutActive and previousBullishBreakoutBars <= maxReversionBarsInput and previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing and currentDownVolume > currentUpVolume and currentDownVolume > nz(previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume, 0.0)
        previousBearishBreakoutActive := false
        previousBullishBreakoutActive := false
        previousBearishBreakoutBars := 0
        previousBullishBreakoutBars := 0
        previousBearishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        previousBullishVolumeWasSlowing := false
        previousLastBearishBreakoutVolume := na
        previousLastBullishBreakoutVolume := na

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 9 - Signal selection and reference levels
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Previous-session signals take priority: that value area is fixed for the whole
// session, while the current-session one is still being built from the same bars
// the signal is measured against.
bool prevLongSignal  = usePreviousSignals and previousBullishReclaimSignal
bool prevShortSignal = usePreviousSignals and previousBearishReclaimSignal
bool currLongSignal  = useCurrentSignals and bullishReclaimSignal
bool currShortSignal = useCurrentSignals and bearishReclaimSignal

int signalDirection = 0
int signalSource = 0
if prevLongSignal
    signalDirection := 1
    signalSource := 1
else if prevShortSignal
    signalDirection := -1
    signalSource := 1
else if currLongSignal
    signalDirection := 1
    signalSource := 2
else if currShortSignal
    signalDirection := -1
    signalSource := 2

float refValueAreaHigh = signalSource == 1 ? previousValueAreaHigh : valueAreaHigh
float refValueAreaLow  = signalSource == 1 ? previousValueAreaLow : valueAreaLow
float refPointOfControl = signalSource == 1 ? previousPointOfControl : pointOfControl
float refBreakoutLow   = signalSource == 1 ? previousBearishBreakoutLow : bearishBreakoutLow
float refBreakoutHigh  = signalSource == 1 ? previousBullishBreakoutHigh : bullishBreakoutHigh

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 10 - Trade geometry
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
float tickSize = syminfo.mintick
float stopBuffer = stopBufferAtrInput * nz(atrValue, 0.0)
float entryProxy = close

float rawStop = na
if signalDirection == 1
    rawStop := switch stopModeInput
        SL_BREAKOUT => math.min(nz(refBreakoutLow, low), low) - stopBuffer
        SL_SIGNAL   => low - stopBuffer
        SL_ATR      => entryProxy - stopAtrMultInput * nz(atrValue, 0.0)
        SL_VAEDGE   => nz(refValueAreaLow, low) - stopBuffer
        => math.min(nz(refBreakoutLow, low), low) - stopBuffer
else if signalDirection == -1
    rawStop := switch stopModeInput
        SL_BREAKOUT => math.max(nz(refBreakoutHigh, high), high) + stopBuffer
        SL_SIGNAL   => high + stopBuffer
        SL_ATR      => entryProxy + stopAtrMultInput * nz(atrValue, 0.0)
        SL_VAEDGE   => nz(refValueAreaHigh, high) + stopBuffer
        => math.max(nz(refBreakoutHigh, high), high) + stopBuffer

float stopDistance = signalDirection == 1 ? entryProxy - rawStop : signalDirection == -1 ? rawStop - entryProxy : na

// Target ladder. A POC or opposite-edge target can sit on the wrong side of the
// entry when the reclaim bar closes far into the value area; those signals fall
// back to the R-multiple rather than being traded with an inverted target.
float rawFirstTarget = na
float rawFinalTarget = na
if signalDirection != 0 and not na(stopDistance)
    float sign = signalDirection
    rawFirstTarget := switch firstTargetInput
        TP_POC => refPointOfControl
        TP_OPP => signalDirection == 1 ? refValueAreaHigh : refValueAreaLow
        TP_R   => entryProxy + sign * firstTargetRInput * stopDistance
        TP_ATR => entryProxy + sign * firstTargetAtrInput * nz(atrValue, 0.0)
        => refPointOfControl
    rawFinalTarget := switch finalTargetInput
        TP_OPP => signalDirection == 1 ? refValueAreaHigh : refValueAreaLow
        TP_POC => refPointOfControl
        TP_R   => entryProxy + sign * finalTargetRInput * stopDistance
        TP_ATR => entryProxy + sign * finalTargetAtrInput * nz(atrValue, 0.0)
        => signalDirection == 1 ? refValueAreaHigh : refValueAreaLow

bool finalTargetValid = signalDirection == 1 ? not na(rawFinalTarget) and rawFinalTarget > entryProxy + tickSize : signalDirection == -1 ? not na(rawFinalTarget) and rawFinalTarget < entryProxy - tickSize : false
float finalTarget = finalTargetValid ? rawFinalTarget : signalDirection != 0 and not na(stopDistance) ? entryProxy + signalDirection * finalTargetRInput * stopDistance : na

bool firstTargetValid = false
if signalDirection == 1 and not na(rawFirstTarget) and not na(finalTarget)
    firstTargetValid := rawFirstTarget > entryProxy + tickSize and rawFirstTarget < finalTarget
else if signalDirection == -1 and not na(rawFirstTarget) and not na(finalTarget)
    firstTargetValid := rawFirstTarget < entryProxy - tickSize and rawFirstTarget > finalTarget
float firstTarget = firstTargetValid ? rawFirstTarget : finalTarget
bool takePartial = usePartialInput and firstTargetValid

float rewardRisk = not na(stopDistance) and stopDistance > 0 and not na(finalTarget) ? math.abs(finalTarget - entryProxy) / stopDistance : na

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 11 - Entry filters
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
bool inTradingWindow = not useTradingWindowInput or not na(time(timeframe.period, tradingWindowInput, ANCHOR_TIMEZONE))
bool directionAllowed = tradeDirectionInput == DIR_BOTH or (tradeDirectionInput == DIR_LONG and signalDirection == 1) or (tradeDirectionInput == DIR_SHORT and signalDirection == -1)
bool stopDistanceOk = not na(stopDistance) and stopDistance >= minStopTicksInput * tickSize and (maxStopAtrInput <= 0.0 or na(atrValue) or stopDistance <= maxStopAtrInput * atrValue)
bool rewardRiskOk = not na(rewardRisk) and rewardRisk >= minRewardRiskInput
bool sessionRoomOk = sessionEntryCount < maxTradesPerSessionInput
bool flatNow = strategy.position_size == 0

bool tradeAllowed = signalDirection != 0 and barstate.isconfirmed and directionAllowed and inTradingWindow and stopDistanceOk and rewardRiskOk and sessionRoomOk and flatNow and not isNewAnchor

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 12 - Position sizing
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
float riskPerUnit = not na(stopDistance) ? stopDistance * syminfo.pointvalue : na
float riskCapital = strategy.equity * riskPercentInput / 100.0
int riskQty = not na(riskPerUnit) and riskPerUnit > 0 ? int(math.floor(riskCapital / riskPerUnit)) : 0
int orderQty = sizingModeInput == SZ_FIXED ? fixedQtyInput : math.max(1, math.min(maxQtyInput, riskQty))

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 13 - Trade state
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
var int    tradeDirection = 0
var int    tradeSourceId = 0
var string activeEntryId = ""
var float  activeStop = na
var float  activeFirstTarget = na
var float  activeFinalTarget = na
var float  initialQty = na
var float  tradeRiskDistance = na
var float  tradeRefVaLow = na
var float  tradeRefVaHigh = na
var int    tradeEntryBar = na
var bool   breakevenDone = false
var bool   partialFilled = false
var bool   tradeTakesPartial = false

var int signalsSeen = 0
var int signalsSkipped = 0
if signalDirection != 0
    signalsSeen += 1
    if not tradeAllowed
        signalsSkipped += 1

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 14 - Stats bookkeeping (indexed by entry bar so partial exits fold together)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
var map<int, float> riskByEntry = map.new<int, float>()
var map<int, float> qtyByEntry = map.new<int, float>()
var map<int, float> srcByEntry = map.new<int, float>()
var map<int, float> fracByEntry = map.new<int, float>()
var map<int, float> rByEntry = map.new<int, float>()
var int processedClosedTrades = 0
var array<int> tradeCountBySource = array.from(0, 0)
var array<int> winCountBySource = array.from(0, 0)
var array<float> sumRBySource = array.from(0.0, 0.0)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 15 - Entries
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
string longEntryId = signalSource == 1 ? "L-PVA" : "L-CVA"
string shortEntryId = signalSource == 1 ? "S-PVA" : "S-CVA"

if tradeAllowed and signalDirection == 1
    strategy.entry(longEntryId, strategy.long, qty = orderQty)
    tradeDirection := 1
    tradeSourceId := signalSource
    activeEntryId := longEntryId
    activeStop := rawStop
    activeFirstTarget := firstTarget
    activeFinalTarget := finalTarget
    initialQty := orderQty
    tradeRiskDistance := stopDistance
    tradeRefVaLow := refValueAreaLow
    tradeRefVaHigh := refValueAreaHigh
    tradeEntryBar := bar_index
    breakevenDone := false
    partialFilled := false
    tradeTakesPartial := takePartial
    sessionEntryCount += 1
    map.put(riskByEntry, bar_index, stopDistance)
    map.put(qtyByEntry, bar_index, float(orderQty))
    map.put(srcByEntry, bar_index, float(signalSource))

if tradeAllowed and signalDirection == -1
    strategy.entry(shortEntryId, strategy.short, qty = orderQty)
    tradeDirection := -1
    tradeSourceId := signalSource
    activeEntryId := shortEntryId
    activeStop := rawStop
    activeFirstTarget := firstTarget
    activeFinalTarget := finalTarget
    initialQty := orderQty
    tradeRiskDistance := stopDistance
    tradeRefVaLow := refValueAreaLow
    tradeRefVaHigh := refValueAreaHigh
    tradeEntryBar := bar_index
    breakevenDone := false
    partialFilled := false
    tradeTakesPartial := takePartial
    sessionEntryCount += 1
    map.put(riskByEntry, bar_index, stopDistance)
    map.put(qtyByEntry, bar_index, float(orderQty))
    map.put(srcByEntry, bar_index, float(signalSource))

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 16 - Trade management
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
float openSize = math.abs(strategy.position_size)

// Detect the first-target fill: the position shrank without going flat.
if tradeDirection != 0 and openSize > 0 and not na(initialQty) and openSize < initialQty - 0.0000001
    partialFilled := true

if moveToBreakevenInput and partialFilled and not breakevenDone and tradeDirection != 0 and not na(tradeRiskDistance)
    float beOffset = breakevenOffsetAtrInput * nz(atrValue, 0.0)
    activeStop := strategy.position_avg_price + tradeDirection * beOffset
    breakevenDone := true

// Issued on the SIGNAL bar as well as every bar the position is open. The entry
// is a market order that fills at the next bar's open; waiting for the fill to
// be visible before bracketing it would leave one full bar unprotected.
if tradeDirection != 0 and not na(activeStop) and not na(activeFinalTarget) and activeEntryId != ""
    if tradeTakesPartial and not partialFilled
        strategy.exit("VA-TP1", activeEntryId, qty_percent = partialPercentInput, stop = activeStop, limit = activeFirstTarget)
    strategy.exit("VA-TP2", activeEntryId, stop = activeStop, limit = activeFinalTarget)

// Invalidation: the trade says the breakout failed. A close back outside the
// reference value area says it did not.
bool longRebreak = tradeDirection == 1 and not na(tradeRefVaLow) and close < tradeRefVaLow
bool shortRebreak = tradeDirection == -1 and not na(tradeRefVaHigh) and close > tradeRefVaHigh
if exitOnRebreakInput and openSize > 0 and (longRebreak or shortRebreak)
    strategy.close_all(comment = "VA re-break")

bool timeStopHit = maxBarsInTradeInput > 0 and tradeDirection != 0 and not na(tradeEntryBar) and bar_index - tradeEntryBar >= maxBarsInTradeInput
if timeStopHit and openSize > 0
    strategy.close_all(comment = "Time stop")

if flatAtAnchorInput and isNewAnchor and openSize > 0
    strategy.close_all(comment = "Anchor rollover")

// Position sync: clear the state machine once flat so a stale stop cannot leak
// into the next trade.
// Guarded on bar_index: on the signal bar the entry has not filled yet, so an
// unguarded flat check would erase the trade state before it is ever used.
if strategy.position_size == 0 and tradeDirection != 0 and not na(tradeEntryBar) and bar_index > tradeEntryBar
    tradeDirection := 0
    tradeSourceId := 0
    activeEntryId := ""
    activeStop := na
    activeFirstTarget := na
    activeFinalTarget := na
    initialQty := na
    tradeRiskDistance := na
    tradeRefVaLow := na
    tradeRefVaHigh := na
    tradeEntryBar := na
    breakevenDone := false
    partialFilled := false
    tradeTakesPartial := false

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 17 - Closed-trade accounting
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
if strategy.closedtrades > processedClosedTrades
    for tradeIndex = processedClosedTrades to strategy.closedtrades - 1
        int entryBar = strategy.closedtrades.entry_bar_index(tradeIndex)
        if map.contains(riskByEntry, entryBar)
            float storedRisk = map.get(riskByEntry, entryBar)
            float storedQty = map.get(qtyByEntry, entryBar)
            float storedSource = map.get(srcByEntry, entryBar)
            float closedSize = strategy.closedtrades.size(tradeIndex)
            float sizeSign = closedSize >= 0 ? 1.0 : -1.0
            float entryFill = strategy.closedtrades.entry_price(tradeIndex)
            float exitFill = strategy.closedtrades.exit_price(tradeIndex)
            float sizeFraction = storedQty > 0 ? math.abs(closedSize) / storedQty : 1.0
            float partialR = storedRisk > 0 ? (exitFill - entryFill) * sizeSign / storedRisk * sizeFraction : 0.0
            map.put(rByEntry, entryBar, nz(map.get(rByEntry, entryBar), 0.0) + partialR)
            map.put(fracByEntry, entryBar, nz(map.get(fracByEntry, entryBar), 0.0) + sizeFraction)
            if map.get(fracByEntry, entryBar) >= 0.999
                float totalR = map.get(rByEntry, entryBar)
                int sourceIndex = storedSource == 1.0 ? 0 : 1
                array.set(tradeCountBySource, sourceIndex, array.get(tradeCountBySource, sourceIndex) + 1)
                array.set(sumRBySource, sourceIndex, array.get(sumRBySource, sourceIndex) + totalR)
                if totalR > 0
                    array.set(winCountBySource, sourceIndex, array.get(winCountBySource, sourceIndex) + 1)
                map.remove(riskByEntry, entryBar)
                map.remove(qtyByEntry, entryBar)
                map.remove(srcByEntry, entryBar)
                map.remove(rByEntry, entryBar)
                map.remove(fracByEntry, entryBar)
    processedClosedTrades := strategy.closedtrades

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 18 - Signal accounting by source
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
var array<int> signalsBySource = array.from(0, 0)
var array<int> skippedBySource = array.from(0, 0)
if signalDirection != 0
    int srcIdx = signalSource == 1 ? 0 : 1
    array.set(signalsBySource, srcIdx, array.get(signalsBySource, srcIdx) + 1)
    if not tradeAllowed
        array.set(skippedBySource, srcIdx, array.get(skippedBySource, srcIdx) + 1)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 19 - Value-area levels on the chart
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
bool drawCurrentLevels = showLevelsInput and useCurrentSignals
bool drawPreviousLevels = showLevelsInput and hasPreviousProfile

plot(drawCurrentLevels and not na(valueAreaHigh) ? valueAreaHigh : na, "Current VAH", color = valueAreaHighColorInput, style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 2)
plot(drawCurrentLevels and not na(valueAreaLow) ? valueAreaLow : na, "Current VAL", color = valueAreaLowColorInput, style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 2)
plot(drawCurrentLevels and showPocInput and not na(pointOfControl) ? pointOfControl : na, "Current POC", color = pocColorInput, style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 2)
plot(drawPreviousLevels and not na(previousValueAreaHigh) ? previousValueAreaHigh : na, "Previous VAH", color = color.new(valueAreaHighColorInput, 25), style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 1)
plot(drawPreviousLevels and not na(previousValueAreaLow) ? previousValueAreaLow : na, "Previous VAL", color = color.new(valueAreaLowColorInput, 25), style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 1)
plot(drawPreviousLevels and showPocInput and not na(previousPointOfControl) ? previousPointOfControl : na, "Previous POC", color = color.new(pocColorInput, 25), style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 1)

plot(tradeDirection != 0 and not na(activeStop) ? activeStop : na, "Active stop", color = color.new(color.red, 20), style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 1)
plot(tradeDirection != 0 and not na(activeFinalTarget) ? activeFinalTarget : na, "Active target", color = color.new(color.teal, 20), style = plot.style_linebr, linewidth = 1)

plotshape(showSignalMarkersInput and prevLongSignal, "Previous VA bullish reclaim", style = shape.triangleup, location = location.belowbar, color = bullishReclaimSignalColorInput, text = "PVA", textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(showSignalMarkersInput and prevShortSignal, "Previous VA bearish reclaim", style = shape.triangledown, location = location.abovebar, color = bearishReclaimSignalColorInput, text = "PVA", textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(showSignalMarkersInput and currLongSignal, "Current VA bullish reclaim", style = shape.triangleup, location = location.belowbar, color = bullishReclaimSignalColorInput, text = "CVA", textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(showSignalMarkersInput and currShortSignal, "Current VA bearish reclaim", style = shape.triangledown, location = location.abovebar, color = bearishReclaimSignalColorInput, text = "CVA", textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(showSignalMarkersInput and signalDirection != 0 and not tradeAllowed, "Filtered signal", style = shape.xcross, location = location.abovebar, color = color.new(color.gray, 30), size = size.tiny)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 20 - Profile histograms (ported from the indicator, redrawn on the last bar)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
if barstate.islast
    if array.size(profileBoxArray) > 0
        for boxIndex = 0 to array.size(profileBoxArray) - 1
            box.delete(array.get(profileBoxArray, boxIndex))
        array.clear(profileBoxArray)

    if showProfileInput and totalProfileVolume > 0 and maximumBinVolume > 0
        int barsSinceAnchor = math.max(1, bar_index - activeAnchorBarIndex + 1)
        int availableWidth = math.max(1, math.min(profileWidthInput, barsSinceAnchor))
        for binIndex = 0 to profileBinCount - 1
            float binVolume = array.get(profileVolumeArray, binIndex)
            if binVolume > 0
                float upBinVolume = array.get(profileUpVolumeArray, binIndex)
                float downBinVolume = array.get(profileDownVolumeArray, binIndex)
                float rowBottom = profileLow + binIndex * binSize
                float rowTop = rowBottom + binSize
                bool insignificantBin = binVolume < maximumBinVolume * insignificantThresholdInput / 100.0
                if insignificantBin
                    int insignificantWidth = math.max(1, int(math.round(availableWidth * binVolume / maximumBinVolume)))
                    box insignificantBox = box.new(activeAnchorBarIndex, rowTop, activeAnchorBarIndex + insignificantWidth, rowBottom, xloc = xloc.bar_index, border_color = profileOutlineColorInput, bgcolor = insignificantProfileColorInput)
                    array.push(profileBoxArray, insignificantBox)
                else
                    int downWidth = int(math.round(availableWidth * downBinVolume / maximumBinVolume))
                    int upWidth = int(math.round(availableWidth * upBinVolume / maximumBinVolume))
                    downWidth := downBinVolume > 0 ? math.max(1, downWidth) : 0
                    upWidth := upBinVolume > 0 ? math.max(1, upWidth) : 0
                    if downWidth > 0
                        box downBox = box.new(activeAnchorBarIndex, rowTop, activeAnchorBarIndex + downWidth, rowBottom, xloc = xloc.bar_index, border_color = profileOutlineColorInput, bgcolor = downVolumeColorInput)
                        array.push(profileBoxArray, downBox)
                    if upWidth > 0
                        box upBox = box.new(activeAnchorBarIndex + downWidth, rowTop, activeAnchorBarIndex + downWidth + upWidth, rowBottom, xloc = xloc.bar_index, border_color = profileOutlineColorInput, bgcolor = upVolumeColorInput)
                        array.push(profileBoxArray, upBox)

    if showPreviousProfileInput and hasPreviousProfile and array.size(previousProfileVolumeArray) > 0
        int previousProfileBinCount = array.size(previousProfileVolumeArray)
        int previousBarsSinceAnchor = math.max(1, bar_index - previousAnchorBarIndex + 1)
        int previousAvailableWidth = math.max(1, math.min(profileWidthInput, previousBarsSinceAnchor))
        float previousMaximumBinVolume = 0.0
        for binIndex = 0 to previousProfileBinCount - 1
            previousMaximumBinVolume := math.max(previousMaximumBinVolume, array.get(previousProfileVolumeArray, binIndex))
        if previousMaximumBinVolume > 0
            for binIndex = 0 to previousProfileBinCount - 1
                float previousBinVolume = array.get(previousProfileVolumeArray, binIndex)
                if previousBinVolume > 0
                    float previousUpVolume = array.get(previousProfileUpVolumeArray, binIndex)
                    float previousDownVolume = array.get(previousProfileDownVolumeArray, binIndex)
                    int previousWidth = math.max(1, int(math.round(previousAvailableWidth * previousBinVolume / previousMaximumBinVolume)))
                    bool previousInsignificantBin = previousBinVolume < previousMaximumBinVolume * insignificantThresholdInput / 100.0
                    color previousBinColor = previousInsignificantBin ? insignificantProfileColorInput : previousUpVolume >= previousDownVolume ? color.new(upVolumeColorInput, 55) : color.new(downVolumeColorInput, 55)
                    float previousRowBottom = previousProfileLow + binIndex * previousBinSize
                    float previousRowTop = previousRowBottom + previousBinSize
                    box previousBox = box.new(previousAnchorBarIndex, previousRowTop, previousAnchorBarIndex + previousWidth, previousRowBottom, xloc = xloc.bar_index, border_color = profileOutlineColorInput, bgcolor = previousBinColor)
                    array.push(profileBoxArray, previousBox)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 21 - Dashboard
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The previous / current split is the point of this table. If one source carries
// the whole result, the other is not an edge -- it is padding on the trade count.
var table dashboard = table.new(position.top_right, 4, 9, bgcolor = color.new(color.black, 15), border_width = 1, border_color = color.new(color.gray, 60))

formatRatio(int wins, int total) =>
    total > 0 ? str.tostring(100.0 * wins / total, "#.#") + "%" : "--"

formatAverage(float total, int count) =>
    count > 0 ? str.tostring(total / count, "#.##") + "R" : "--"

if showDashboardInput and barstate.islast
    int prevTrades = array.get(tradeCountBySource, 0)
    int currTrades = array.get(tradeCountBySource, 1)
    int prevWins = array.get(winCountBySource, 0)
    int currWins = array.get(winCountBySource, 1)
    float prevSumR = array.get(sumRBySource, 0)
    float currSumR = array.get(sumRBySource, 1)
    color headerColor = color.new(color.gray, 70)
    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 0, "VARS-S", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = headerColor)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 0, "Prev VA", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = headerColor)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 0, "Curr VA", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = headerColor)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 0, "Total", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small, bgcolor = headerColor)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 1, "Signals", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 1, str.tostring(array.get(signalsBySource, 0)), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 1, str.tostring(array.get(signalsBySource, 1)), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 1, str.tostring(signalsSeen), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 2, "Filtered out", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 2, str.tostring(array.get(skippedBySource, 0)), text_color = color.orange, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 2, str.tostring(array.get(skippedBySource, 1)), text_color = color.orange, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 2, str.tostring(signalsSkipped), text_color = color.orange, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 3, "Trades", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 3, str.tostring(prevTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 3, str.tostring(currTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 3, str.tostring(prevTrades + currTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 4, "Win rate", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 4, formatRatio(prevWins, prevTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 4, formatRatio(currWins, currTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 4, formatRatio(prevWins + currWins, prevTrades + currTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 5, "Avg R", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 5, formatAverage(prevSumR, prevTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 5, formatAverage(currSumR, currTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 5, formatAverage(prevSumR + currSumR, prevTrades + currTrades), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 6, "Total R", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 6, str.tostring(prevSumR, "#.##"), text_color = prevSumR >= 0 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 6, str.tostring(currSumR, "#.##"), text_color = currSumR >= 0 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 6, str.tostring(prevSumR + currSumR, "#.##"), text_color = prevSumR + currSumR >= 0 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 7, "Net profit", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 7, "", text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 7, "", text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 7, str.tostring(strategy.netprofit, "#.##"), text_color = strategy.netprofit >= 0 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.small)

    table.cell(dashboard, 0, 8, "Position", text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 1, 8, tradeSourceId == 1 ? "active" : "", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 2, 8, tradeSourceId == 2 ? "active" : "", text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(dashboard, 3, 8, str.tostring(strategy.position_size), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 22 - Alerts
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
alertcondition(prevLongSignal, "Previous VA bullish reclaim", "Bullish volume reclaimed the previous session's value area after a bearish breakout.")
alertcondition(prevShortSignal, "Previous VA bearish reclaim", "Bearish volume reclaimed the previous session's value area after a bullish breakout.")
alertcondition(currLongSignal, "Current VA bullish reclaim", "Bullish volume reclaimed the current session's developing value area after a bearish breakout.")
alertcondition(currShortSignal, "Current VA bearish reclaim", "Bearish volume reclaimed the current session's developing value area after a bullish breakout.")

if tradeAllowed
    alert(str.format("VARS-S {0} {1} @ {2} stop {3} target {4} ({5}R)", signalDirection == 1 ? "LONG" : "SHORT", syminfo.ticker, str.tostring(close, format.mintick), str.tostring(rawStop, format.mintick), str.tostring(finalTarget, format.mintick), str.tostring(rewardRisk, "#.##")), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
